; The launchers are scripts: they need the script bit, which a copy from a PC folder does not carry. SparkyDave starts the NES
; look, SparkyDave-AllStars the All-Stars look (it runs SparkyDave allstars); each has its icon.
COPY sparky-dave:S/SparkyDave TO sparky-dave:compiled/SparkyDave QUIET
PROTECT sparky-dave:compiled/SparkyDave +s
COPY sparky-dave:S/SparkyDave-AllStars TO sparky-dave:compiled/SparkyDave-AllStars QUIET
PROTECT sparky-dave:compiled/SparkyDave-AllStars +s
